* A global label made by a macro argument (_S\1:) is exported by each expansion.
* fixed: 194231a 2026-10-09 r68togas: first fixes from comparisons with Microware's r68; m68k-os9-r68 -dialect=c32
* expect sym: T _Sone 00000000
* expect sym: T _Stwo 00000004
 psect macro_label,0,0,0,0,0
DEFS macro
_S\1: dc.b "\1",0
 endm
 DEFS one
 DEFS two
 ends
